
@startuml
title RAMT - System Architecture (English to Kannada)

top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 22

actor User

package "Frontend" {
  [Next.js UI] as UI
}

package "Backend - FastAPI" {
  [Input Normalizer] as Norm
  [Retrieval Filter] as Filter
  [Context Builder] as Context
  [Output Postprocessor] as Post
}

package "Retrieval Layer" {
  [LaBSE Encoder] as LaBSE
  [FAISS Vector Search] as FAISS
  database "Translation Memory\nSQLite / PostgreSQL" as TMDB
}

package "Translation Layer" {
  [IndicNLP\nScript Processing] as IndicNLP
  [SentencePiece Tokenizer] as Tok
  [IndicTrans2\nTransformer Model] as MT
}

package "Offline Indexing" {
  [Parallel Corpus] as Corpus
  [Cleaning + Deduplication] as Clean
  [Metadata + Embeddings] as Embed
}

User --> UI
UI --> Norm : Source sentence
Norm --> LaBSE : Encode query
LaBSE --> FAISS : Query vector
FAISS --> Filter : Candidate IDs + scores
Filter --> TMDB : Fetch candidate pairs
TMDB --> Filter : Bilingual examples
Filter --> Context : Top-k matches\nor empty context
Norm --> Context : Original input
Context --> IndicNLP
IndicNLP --> Tok
Tok --> MT : Token IDs + target tag
MT --> Post : Generated tokens
Post --> UI : Kannada translation
UI --> User : Display result

Corpus --> Clean
Clean --> Embed
Embed --> TMDB : Store bilingual pairs
Embed --> FAISS : Build vector index

note right of Filter
Threshold: 0.75 initially
Tune using validation data.
No valid match = baseline fallback.
end note

@enduml
